# Exceptions to the tile-crate rule (tests/dependency_ratchet.rs): a crate named `iyakki-tile-*` may depend on `iyakki-uikit` and nothing else
# named `iyakki-*`, unless a line here says so. One line per exception: <tile crate> <dependency> <why, until when>.
# The list may only shrink: a line that no longer matches a real dependency fails the test until it is removed.
# (`iyakki-tile-usage` needs only `iyakki-uikit` and `iyakki-tile-api`, see docs/development/COMPILE-SPLIT-PILOT.md.)
iyakki-tile-pdf iyakki-pdf the reader library is the tile's engine: a parser and renderer for untrusted files with no I/O and no agent (it depends on iyakki-web for the picture decoders); removed if the engine ever moves behind a tile-api trait (docs/development/COMPILE-SPLIT-PILOT-5.md)
iyakki-tile-hostfiles iyakki-hostfiles the rules of the host-files bridge (import, mounts, export; no agent) are the dialog's engine; removed if they ever move behind a tile-api trait
iyakki-tile-board iyakki-board-model the board's data and logic (features file, dependencies, assignment, results, coverage) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports; the tile cannot name iyakki-shared (alpha.7 S2, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-board iyakki-clock times and days on the board cards (std only leaf crate, split out of the agent; alpha.7 S2, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-disks iyakki-disks-model the drive model and the DiskEngine trait as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-core-api re-exports under the old path; the tile cannot name the core API (alpha.8 E2, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-learn iyakki-study-model the study plans, quizzes and lessons (data types and pure rules) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports; the tile cannot name iyakki-shared (alpha.8 E3, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-dash iyakki-dash the dashboard engine (model, frame, expressions, connectors, sharing rules; no agent, no vault) is the tile's data model and its charts draw its frames; a leaf crate that iyakki-shared and the agent also use (alpha.8 E3, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-k8s iyakki-k8s-model the cluster explorer's engine (kubectl argument arrays, the Kube trait and its fake, bounded lists, details, logs, retry tracking) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports; the tile cannot name iyakki-shared (alpha.8 E2 and E7, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-k8s iyakki-cluster-model the cluster registry (entries, per-account rules, confirmation texts) and the cloud launch plan and route table as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.8 E7, D-E7-01)
iyakki-tile-k8s iyakki-sec the role (`Role`) of the person: the registry and the switcher decide by it; the leaf crate that already carries the policy types (alpha.8 E7, D-E7-01)
iyakki-tile-devtools iyakki-devtools-engine the thirteen tools as plain functions (JSON, query, Base64, JWT, URL, hash, UUID and time, regex, diff, converters, QR text and pictures); no screen, no I/O (alpha.8 E7, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-devtools iyakki-qr the QR code types the engine's pictures are made from; std-only leaf crate (alpha.8 E7, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-dash iyakki-querybox the query box (text engine on the toolkit) that the FLOWS tile crate shares; replaces the former line for iyakki-edit (alpha.8 N1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-flows iyakki-flow the flow engine's model (flow, node, run, kinds catalog, validation, layout, reports) is the tile's data; a leaf crate with no I/O that the agent also uses (alpha.8 N1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-flows iyakki-flows-model the failure book, webhook view, flow spec builder, outside-message policy types and the FlowsPort job traits as a leaf crate that iyakki-flowsx and iyakki-shared re-export; the tile cannot name the agent API or the shared crate (alpha.8 N1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-flows iyakki-querybox the query box shared with the DASH tile (text engine on the toolkit); also taken for the text view and the step settings (alpha.8 N1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-flows iyakki-clock times and days on the cards and the local time zone offset for quiet hours (std only leaf crate; alpha.8 N1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-git iyakki-git-model the git hosts' addresses, connections and API client, the repository browser, the data of the git jobs (operations, phases, items, host prompts, the Batch trait) and the vault and audit traits as a leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports; the tile cannot name the shared crate or the agent API (alpha.8 N1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-git iyakki-k8s-model the retry timer and its fake, the program runner trait and its fake, and the age text; the leaf crate the K8S model already is, shared with the git model (alpha.8 N1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-lab iyakki-lab-model the LAB's data and rules (models and where they run, requests, the log lines, speech and video frames, the backend and frame-source traits) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports; the tile cannot name iyakki-shared (alpha.9 P5, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-lab iyakki-clock the time zone and the clock of the log lines and the job stamps (std only leaf crate; alpha.9 P5, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-lab iyakki-testkit named locks and the wall-clock wait for the fake-port tests (test-only leaf crate, a dev-dependency; alpha.9 P5, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-inbox iyakki-inbox-model the notification and task model (kinds, priorities, links, snoozing, sorting) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports; the tile cannot name iyakki-shared (alpha.9 P5, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-inbox iyakki-clock the time zone and the clock of the list rows and the due dates (std only leaf crate; alpha.9 P5, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-system iyakki-sysinfo-model the System page's figures and rules (memory, byte and time words, roots, counters, processes, processor use, protected processes), the kubectl trait and the pod table and process rows, as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-core-api and iyakki-shared re-export; the tile cannot name the core API or the shared crate (alpha.9 P6, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-system iyakki-clock the time of the cluster health check and the age of the figures (std only leaf crate; alpha.9 P6, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-story-model the story options, enums, prompts, parsing, the Synth, Sink and StoryReader traits, DirectVoice, StoryPdf and ModelChoice as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-story-kit the TALES helpers that are not data (messages, steering and hint parsers, audio pieces, the HTML export, the library on disk, the speech status, picture planning, the follow-a-run loop) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-voice-model the speech types (engines, settings, host engines and voices, the voice helper state, HostTtsApi) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-chat-model messages, roles and the ChatBackend trait as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-scene scene JSON, vector art, character sheet and reply checks as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-piclog the picture log as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-provider-kind provider kinds, ImageParams, the picture trace, PullStatus and Lemonade's model types as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-chatview the chat transcript view, the picture cache and the model chooser on the toolkit (UI layer; no agent, no shared crate) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-sysinfo-model the Memory figure a picture model is compared with (a pure leaf crate that the core API re-exports) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-web the WebM poster decoder for a clip's first picture (a pure decoder crate with no I/O) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-sec the account policy type the fake port's library is opened with (dev-dependency only) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-filescope the file roots the fake port's library is opened with (dev-dependency only) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-tales iyakki-testkit named locks and the wall-clock wait for the fake-port tests (test-only leaf crate, a dev-dependency) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-voice iyakki-voice-model the speech types, the voice desk (microphones, recorders, pause detection, commands), dictation fixing, the revision kit, recordings, the voice assistant's state machine, the host speech engines and the traits the tile and the agent both name (speech kit, voice desk, mine worker, pending waker) as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-voice iyakki-story-model the Synth, Sink, Playing and StoryReader traits and DirectVoice, the engine of this computer that speaks by itself, as a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-voice iyakki-speechtime where a speech server is (local, LAN, remote) for the consent card (std only leaf crate) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-voice iyakki-filescope the file roots the picker and the read check use (a pure leaf crate over the policy) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-voice iyakki-testkit named locks and the wall-clock wait for the fake-port tests (test-only leaf crate, a dev-dependency) (alpha.11 AP1, D-S2-01)
iyakki-tile-store iyakki-store-model the store's pure model (packages, catalog, trust, installed list, lifecycle, organize, ratings, licence, update check) that the STORE screens name through the engine trait; a leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.10 AP3, D-Q4-04)
iyakki-tile-store iyakki-sec the account policy the store's calls take (a pure leaf crate over the policy) (alpha.10 AP3, D-Q4-04)
iyakki-tile-store iyakki-cluster-model the cluster registry types (ClusterEntry, confirm_text, Registry) the Setup tab names, a pure leaf crate that iyakki-shared re-exports (alpha.10 AP3, D-AP3-02)
